     "compare_against": "**UTC-date(T_scheduled)**,**不得使用 releaseDate**(公告通常提前数日至数周发布)",
     "NEW_QUOTE_PAIR_EXISTING_ASSET": "该 baseAsset 任一交易对的 earliest_trade_day **<** UTC-date(T_scheduled)",
